Openers still open at end of file: an array literal whose last line ends
in ',' and never closes. unclosed_delimiter reports the opener itself,
not end of file; the formatter must not invent a closer.
-- input.ssl --
:DECLARE aItems, nFirst;
nFirst := 1;
aItems := {4, 5,
-- format --
:DECLARE aItems, nFirst;

nFirst := 1;
aItems := {4, 5,
-- diagnostics --
3:11-3:12 error unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed '{'
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:11-3:12 error unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed '{'
